<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1370108695"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1462628902"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Bad Reputation"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Avicii / Joe Janiak"/><amll:meta key="album" value="TIM"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:25.417"><div begin="00:10.804" end="03:02.353"><p begin="00:10.804" end="00:13.244" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Can you see my emotion<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你注意到我的表情了吗</span></p><p begin="00:13.244" end="00:15.895" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Sinking away in slow motion?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">神采慢慢褪去</span></p><p begin="00:16.126" end="00:18.624" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Like a break in the ocean<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像海里的裂缝</span></p><p begin="00:18.624" end="00:20.984" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Just getting lost out at sea<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在一片汪洋间迷失</span></p><p begin="00:21.469" end="00:23.901" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">Can you see my emotion<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你注意到我的表情了吗</span></p><p begin="00:23.901" end="00:26.603" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Say, can you see my devotion?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看得见我眼里的忠诚吗</span></p><p begin="00:26.789" end="00:29.269" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">Like a break in the ocean<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像海里的裂缝</span></p><p begin="00:29.269" end="00:31.387" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">Just getting lost out at sea<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在一片汪洋间迷失</span></p><p begin="00:30.903" end="00:35.612" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">I hear what you're saying, I got a bad reputation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我听到你在说</span></p><p begin="00:36.408" end="00:40.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">And now you got me praying for a better situation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你要我祈祷</span></p><p begin="00:41.882" end="00:44.298" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">Feeling like I'm down, d-down, d-down low<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好像在无限坠落 直至谷底</span></p><p begin="00:44.564" end="00:46.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">Feeling like I'm down, d-down, d-down low<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好像在无限坠落 直至谷底</span></p><p begin="00:47.266" end="00:49.631" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">Guess it's gonna follow me wherever I go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这感觉如影随形 我无处可逃</span></p><p begin="00:49.926" end="00:52.148" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">Guess it's gonna follow me, follow me, I know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这感觉如影随形 我无处可逃 我知道</span></p><p begin="00:52.148" end="00:54.519" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">I got a bad reputation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的名声不好</span></p><p begin="01:04.080" end="01:06.608" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">I know that you've been talking<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我知道你一直在喋喋不休</span></p><p begin="01:06.608" end="01:09.257" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">You never see me sleepwalking<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你从没注意到我在神游</span></p><p begin="01:09.481" end="01:11.926" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">Drifting out into nothing<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">飘向虚无</span></p><p begin="01:11.926" end="01:14.441" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">Rolling away in my dreams<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在梦里徜徉</span></p><p begin="01:14.758" end="01:17.263" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">Can you feel that I'm falling?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你感受到我在坠落了吗</span></p><p begin="01:17.263" end="01:19.926" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">Laying awake till the morning<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彻夜无眠</span></p><p begin="01:20.122" end="01:22.623" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Every word that I'm calling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我呼喊的每字每句</span></p><p begin="01:22.623" end="01:24.745" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">Just getting lost out at sea<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">激不起一丝风浪</span></p><p begin="01:24.246" end="01:28.934" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">I hear what you're saying, I got a bad reputation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我听到你在说</span></p><p begin="01:29.708" end="01:34.286" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">And now you got me praying for a better situation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你要我祈祷</span></p><p begin="01:35.185" end="01:37.600" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Feeling like I'm down, d-down, d-down low<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好像在无限坠落 直至谷底</span></p><p begin="01:37.902" end="01:40.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">Feeling like I'm down, d-down, d-down low<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好像在无限坠落 直至谷底</span></p><p begin="01:40.588" end="01:42.937" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">Guess it's gonna follow me wherever I go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这感觉如影随形 我无处可逃</span></p><p begin="01:43.226" end="01:45.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">Guess it's gonna follow me, follow me, I know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这感觉如影随形 我无处可逃 我知道</span></p><p begin="01:45.480" end="01:47.705" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">I got a bad reputation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的名声不好</span></p><p begin="01:56.085" end="01:58.405" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I got a bad reputation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的名声不好</span></p><p begin="02:07.846" end="02:11.401" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">So you got me figured out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我明白</span></p><p begin="02:11.884" end="02:14.036" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">Know what I'm all about<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是怎样的人</span></p><p begin="02:14.452" end="02:16.943" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">I'm all about dollars and green<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">利欲熏心 为钱所累</span></p><p begin="02:17.057" end="02:19.642" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">Don't care about nothing but me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么都不在乎 只顾自己</span></p><p begin="02:19.905" end="02:22.023" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">You got me figured out<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你让我明白</span></p><p begin="02:22.385" end="02:24.693" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">You know what I'm all about<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是怎样的人</span></p><p begin="02:25.042" end="02:28.190" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">Don't care about nothing but me, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么都不在乎 只顾自己</span></p><p begin="02:28.240" end="02:32.979" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">I hear what you're saying, I got a bad reputation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我听到你在说</span></p><p begin="02:33.721" end="02:38.244" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">And now you got me praying for a better situation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你要我祈祷</span></p><p begin="02:39.163" end="02:41.597" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">Feeling like I'm down, d-down, d-down low<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好像在无限坠落 直至谷底</span></p><p begin="02:41.880" end="02:44.299" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">Feeling like I'm down, d-down, d-down low<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好像在无限坠落 直至谷底</span></p><p begin="02:44.585" end="02:46.981" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Guess it's gonna follow me wherever I go<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这感觉如影随形 我无处可逃</span></p><p begin="02:47.267" end="02:49.483" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">Guess it's gonna follow me, follow me, I know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这感觉如影随形 我无处可逃 我知道</span></p><p begin="02:49.483" end="02:51.727" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">I got a bad reputation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的名声不好</span></p><p begin="03:00.101" end="03:02.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">I got a bad reputation<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的名声不好</span></p></div></body></tt>